#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 15
#: rc.cpp:57
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the panels may not be moved and items cannot be "
"removed or added"
msgstr ""
"Eżle ta òptacëjô bãdze włączonô, nie bãdze mòżno przenosëc panelów, a dodôwk "
"ë rëmanié elementów bãdze niemòżebne"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 20
#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "Enable conserve space"
msgstr "Włączë òbszczãdzanié placu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 25
#: rc.cpp:63
msgid "Raise when the pointer touches the screen here"
msgstr "Zawòłaj, czédë kùrsora zjawi sã w tim môlù"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 30
#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "Fade out applet handles"
msgstr "Rozmëjë chwëtë apletów"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:69
msgid ""
"Select this option to make applet handles only visible on mouse hover. "
"Applet handles let you move, remove and configure applets."
msgstr ""
"Eżle ta òptacëjô bãdze włączonô, chwëtë apletów bãdą widzawne blós pòd "
"kùrsorã mëszë. Chwët apletù pòzwôlô przeniesc, skònfigùrowac abò rëmac aplet."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 36
#: rc.cpp:72
msgid "Hide applet handles"
msgstr "Zatacë chwëtë apletów"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:75
msgid ""
"Select this option to always hide the applet handles. Beware this could "
"disable moving, removing or configuring some applets."
msgstr ""
"Eżle ta òptacëjô je włączonô, chwëtë apletów bãdą wiedno zatacone. Bôczënk: "
"to mòże uniemòżebnic kònfigùracëjã, przenoszenié abò rëmanié niechtërnëch "
"apletów."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 42
#: rc.cpp:78
msgid ""
"A list of applets that have been loaded at runtime. In the case of a crash "
"these applets will not be loaded at the next Kicker start, in case they "
"caused the crash"
msgstr ""
"Lësta apletów wladowanëch òbczas dzejaniô. Na przëtrôfk awarëji apletë te "
"nie òstaną zrëszoné nazôd, na przëpôdk czéjbë to òne robiłë awarëjã"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 46
#: rc.cpp:81
msgid ""
"A list of extensions that have been loaded at runtime. In the case of a "
"crash these extensions will not be loaded at the next Kicker start, in case "
"they caused the crash"
msgstr ""
"Lësta rozszérzeniów wladowónëch òbczas dzejaniô. Na przëtrôfk awarëji "
"rozszérzenia te nie òstaną zrëszony nazôd, na przëpôdk, czéjbë to òne robiłë "
"awarëjã"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 56
#: rc.cpp:84
msgid "Show simple menu entries"
msgstr "Pòkażë ùproscëne môle menu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 59
#: rc.cpp:87
msgid "Show names first on detailed entries"
msgstr "Pòkażë nôpierwi miona "

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 62
#: rc.cpp:90
msgid "Show only description for menu entries"
msgstr "Pòkażë blós òpisënk môlów menu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 65
#: rc.cpp:93
msgid "Show detailed menu entries"
msgstr "Pòkażë dokłôdne môle menu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 69
#: rc.cpp:96
msgid "Formation of the menu entry text"
msgstr "Fòrmat tekstu môla menu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 73
#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Show section titles in Kmenu"
msgstr "Pòkażë titel sekcëji w menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 78
#: rc.cpp:102
msgid "Height of menu entries in pixels"
msgstr "Wiżô môla menu w pikselach"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 83
#: rc.cpp:105
msgid "Show hidden files in Quick Browser"
msgstr "Pòkażë zataconé lopczi w Chùtczim przezéraniù"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 88
#: rc.cpp:108
msgid "Maximum number of entries"
msgstr "Maksymalnô lëczba môlów"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 94
#: rc.cpp:111
msgid "Show bookmarks in KMenu"
msgstr "Pòkażë załóżczi w menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 99
#: rc.cpp:114
msgid "Use the Quick Browser"
msgstr "Brëkùjë Chùtczégò przezéraniô"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 104
#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "Optional Menus"
msgstr "Òptacëjné menu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 108
#: rc.cpp:120
msgid "Recently used applications"
msgstr "Slédno brëkòwónë programë"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 112
#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "Number of visible entries"
msgstr "Lëczba widzalnëch môlów"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 118
#: rc.cpp:126
msgid "Show most recently used applications rather than most frequently used"
msgstr "Pòkażë slédno brëkòwóne programë w môl nôczãsczi brëkòwónëch"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 127
#: rc.cpp:129
msgid "Use side image in Kmenu"
msgstr "Brëkùjë bòcznegò òbrôzkù w menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 132
#: rc.cpp:132
msgid "The name of the file to use as the side image in the K Menu"
msgstr "Miono lopkù bòcznegò òbrôzkù menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 137
#: rc.cpp:135
msgid ""
"The name of the file used as a tile to fill the height of K Menu that "
"SidePixmapName does not cover"
msgstr ""
"Miono lopkù òbrôzka brëkòwónegò do kachlowaniô spòdkù tegò dzélu menu KDE, "
"chtërna nie mô w se bòcznegò òbrôzka"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 142
#: rc.cpp:138
msgid "Show text on the K Menu button"
msgstr "Pòkażr tekst w knąpie menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 147
#: rc.cpp:141
msgid "Text to be shown on K Menu Button"
msgstr "Tekst wëskrzëniwóny w knąpie menu KDE"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 156
#: rc.cpp:144
msgid "Enable icon mouse over effects"
msgstr "Włączë efektë ikònów pòd kùrsorama"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 161
#: rc.cpp:147
msgid "Show icons in mouse over effects"
msgstr "Pòkażë ikònë pòd kùrsorama mëszë"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 166
#: rc.cpp:150
msgid "Show text in mouse over effects"
msgstr "Pòkażë tekst pòd kùrsorã mëszë"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 171
#: rc.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Controls how fast the tooltips fade in, measured in thousandths of a second"
msgstr ""
"Kòntrolëjë chùtkòsc zjawianiô sã pòdpòwiesców (w tysãcznëch dzélach sekùndë)"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 177
#: rc.cpp:156
msgid "Mouse over effects are shown after the defined time (in milliseconds)"
msgstr ""
"Efektë wëskrzëniwónë pòd kùrsorã mëszë są pòkôzëwóne pò zadanym czasie (w "
"milisekùndach)"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 182
#: rc.cpp:159
msgid "Mouse over effects are hidden after the defined time (in milliseconds)"
msgstr ""
"Efektë wëskrzëniwónë pòd kùrsorã mëszë są zatacëwóne pò zadanym czasie (w "
"milisekùndach)"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 187
#: rc.cpp:162
msgid "The margin between panel icons and the panel border"
msgstr "Rozstãpë midze ikònama a grańcą panelu"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 192
#: rc.cpp:165
msgid ""
"Buttons that represent KServices (applications, primarily) watch for the "
"removal of the service and delete themselves when this happens. This setting "
"turns this off."
msgstr ""
"Knąpë reprezentujące ùsłóżnotë KServices (w przédnym dzélu programë) biorą "
"do wiedzë rëmanié ùsłóżnotë ë same tedë rëmôją sã. Ta òptacëjô zezwalô to "
"wëłączëc."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 197
#: rc.cpp:168
msgid "Font for the buttons with text."
msgstr "Fòntë tekstu na knąpach."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 202
#: rc.cpp:171
msgid "Text color for the buttons."
msgstr "Farwa tekstu na knąpach."

